  "contentHtml": "<p>저작원은 KICE에 있습니다만</p><p>온라인 시험으로 대체하면서 기출문제 자료 올라와 있던 것을 지웠더라고요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>시대가 오래되어 교육과정이 많이 바뀌기는 했지만</p><p>그림이라거나 문항 발문 등에 참고하실 수 있을 듯하여 올려봅니다.</p><p>(17년은 치르지 않았다고 합니다)</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd0a89135e1132944fdabf9d6b878f972c222900?download\" data-file-name=\"2009_중3과학_문제.pdf\" data-file-size=\"7534141\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DYNeK%26dataid%3D35%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20230616173231&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fbd0a89135e1132944fdabf9d6b878f972c222900')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2009_중3과학_문제</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">7.19MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bda7dbcecd062d0266bf71b90069669e2ec80f88?download\" data-file-name=\"2010_중3과학_문제.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2284707\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DYNeK%26dataid%3D35%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20230616173231&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fbda7dbcecd062d0266bf71b90069669e2ec80f88')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2010_중3과학_문제</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.18MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bacbd2d0f015699277e6dc60a63bee57cbff6f16?download\" data-file-name=\"2011_중3과학_문제.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2614018\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DYNeK%26dataid%3D35%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D202306161